            <ArticleTitle>Relief of low back pain from treatment of tarsal tunnel syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>327-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors analyzed 44 patients with low back pain and symptoms of tarsal tunnel syndrome. These patients had proximal radiation of pain to the hip, buttocks, or lower back. Treatment directed to the tarsal tunnel syndrome provided relief for these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
